(3243752, 452506, 68648, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe that this meets the challenge: "motion panning" means (to me) moving the camera to track a moving subject.  This image appears to be a slow exposure from a stationary camera to illustrate the motion of the dancers....</td>', 'I don''t believe that this meets the challenge: "motion panning" means (to me) moving the camera to track a moving subject.  This image appears to be a slow exposure from a stationary camera to illustrate the motion of the dancers....', '2007-01-17 00:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3243768, 452581, 51638, '<td valign="top">Works for me. Good job.</td>', 'Works for me. Good job.', '2007-01-17 00:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3243772, 454109, 68648, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe that this meets the challenge: "motion panning" means (to me) moving the camera to track a moving subject.  This image would have had to use a high-speed strobe (and stationary camera, a la Harold Edgerton) to capture a bullet in flight....unless (I suppose) this bullet were hand-tossed.....   I don''t see any panning blur, although if you''re spinning your torso at the speed of a bullet, I''m even more impressed!   :)</td>', 'I don''t believe that this meets the challenge: "motion panning" means (to me) moving the camera to track a moving subject.  This image would have had to use a high-speed strobe (and stationary camera, a la Harold Edgerton) to capture a bullet in flight....unless (I suppose) this bullet were hand-tossed.....   I don''t see any panning blur, although if you''re spinning your torso at the speed of a bullet, I''m even more impressed!   :)', '2007-01-17 00:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3243773, 454248, 61552, '<td valign="top">A flash needed here to brighten the subject.</td>', 'A flash needed here to brighten the subject.', '2007-01-17 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
