(3246467, 451234, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice job of panning.  Two things that might help improve the image:  (1) have more space to fly into rather than behind the bird (that helps with the sense of movement); (2) try to get a dark bird like this against a different colour background, lighter or so, to set it off - as it is, the bird, especially the wing areas, gets lost  agains the background.</td>', 'Nice job of panning.  Two things that might help improve the image:  (1) have more space to fly into rather than behind the bird (that helps with the sense of movement); (2) try to get a dark bird like this against a different colour background, lighter or so, to set it off - as it is, the bird, especially the wing areas, gets lost  agains the background.', '2007-01-17 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246471, 452869, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice one, really shows speed and movement, the colors are also good, lots of red and blue..</td>', 'Nice one, really shows speed and movement, the colors are also good, lots of red and blue..', '2007-01-17 12:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246474, 453856, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the oval shape made by the moving blades :)</td>', 'I like the oval shape made by the moving blades :)', '2007-01-17 12:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246479, 453489, 5112, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a bit more space for the car to drive into would really help here.</td>', 'I wonder if a bit more space for the car to drive into would really help here.', '2007-01-17 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246485, 454261, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the kids wear helmets, good feel of movement..</td>', 'Nice to see the kids wear helmets, good feel of movement..', '2007-01-17 12:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246488, 453480, 5112, '<td valign="top">She''s cute!</td>', 'She''s cute!', '2007-01-17 12:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246502, 451348, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of motion.  One thing that might help improve this image is if there was more space to the front of the little boy (where he''s flying into), less behind - IMO it would both give a better sense of motion and would make for a more dynamic composition.</td>', 'Nice sense of motion.  One thing that might help improve this image is if there was more space to the front of the little boy (where he''s flying into), less behind - IMO it would both give a better sense of motion and would make for a more dynamic composition.', '2007-01-17 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246506, 454318, 66193, '<td valign="top">I suspect that this wasn''t panning, but rather riding around next to the horse.  Nice colors, though.</td>', 'I suspect that this wasn''t panning, but rather riding around next to the horse.  Nice colors, though.', '2007-01-17 12:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246519, 454343, 5112, '<td valign="top">It''s funny to see all those legs, and mainly only one horse head.  The other thing that makes a person stop at this picture is the flags, they are going with the riders, which has a curious effect of sort of slowing down the race.  I love the panning stripes on the scoreboard.</td>', 'It''s funny to see all those legs, and mainly only one horse head.  The other thing that makes a person stop at this picture is the flags, they are going with the riders, which has a curious effect of sort of slowing down the race.  I love the panning stripes on the scoreboard.', '2007-01-17 12:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246523, 452635, 5112, '<td valign="top">The background is beautiful in this image.  I wish the bottoms of the wheels were included, and maybe a bit more space to the left (for the rider to wheel into).</td>', 'The background is beautiful in this image.  I wish the bottoms of the wheels were included, and maybe a bit more space to the left (for the rider to wheel into).', '2007-01-17 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246525, 453933, 31443, '<td valign="top">I would consider this more a bokeh than panning...the photo is exceptional and beautiful, it''s hard not to score it high...</td>', 'I would consider this more a bokeh than panning...the photo is exceptional and beautiful, it''s hard not to score it high...', '2007-01-17 12:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246532, 454141, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  I sort of wish the cycler weren''t quite as centred in the image, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'Love this one.  I sort of wish the cycler weren''t quite as centred in the image, but I''m not sure.', '2007-01-17 12:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246541, 452607, 5112, '<td valign="top">The water is beautiful in this image.</td>', 'The water is beautiful in this image.', '2007-01-17 12:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246546, 452675, 33535, '<td valign="top">well done dude, your imagination is amazing.<br/>would have been nice to see the feet, but anyways, really creative and out-of the box...;)</td>', 'well done dude, your imagination is amazing.would have been nice to see the feet, but anyways, really creative and out-of the box...;)', '2007-01-17 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246566, 451348, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice! A helmet would be a good idea for this little tyke, what determination :)</td>', 'Nice! A helmet would be a good idea for this little tyke, what determination :)', '2007-01-17 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246573, 454345, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I got seasick in those things!</td>', 'Great idea! I got seasick in those things!', '2007-01-17 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246581, 453495, 69604, '<td valign="top">fun picture but not a lot of motion</td>', 'fun picture but not a lot of motion', '2007-01-17 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246587, 453532, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice job of panning.  It would be better if there were more space in front, for  the boat to fly into.</td>', 'Nice job of panning.  It would be better if there were more space in front, for  the boat to fly into.', '2007-01-17 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246592, 453930, 69604, '<td valign="top">to blurry where is the infocus item?</td>', 'to blurry where is the infocus item?', '2007-01-17 12:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246595, 453552, 5112, '<td valign="top">I really like her happy smile.  You might consider cropping off the top part of the image, where the two sets of legs are showing, and, if possible, placing the little girl a bit more to one side (so she has either some space to fly into, or some space from which to fly out).</td>', 'I really like her happy smile.  You might consider cropping off the top part of the image, where the two sets of legs are showing, and, if possible, placing the little girl a bit more to one side (so she has either some space to fly into, or some space from which to fly out).', '2007-01-17 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246600, 452702, 31443, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor but this could be dangerous! They''re obviously having lots of fun, well done!</td>', 'Good sense of humor but this could be dangerous! They''re obviously having lots of fun, well done!', '2007-01-17 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3246612, 451738, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and different..</td>', 'Nice idea and different..', '2007-01-17 12:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
