(3247015, 453974, 69388, '<td valign="top">Very nice effects with the neon lights in the background;and the car looks tack sharp.</td>', 'Very nice effects with the neon lights in the background;and the car looks tack sharp.', '2007-01-17 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247018, 453577, 5792, '<td valign="top">Bummer... this is not motion panning. Motion panning is moving the camera to follow your main subject. Normally, the main subject is in clear focus and the background is not. You will want to practice the technique. It is not all that easy sometimes, but you will like the results when you get a good motion panning capture. :)</td>', 'Bummer... this is not motion panning. Motion panning is moving the camera to follow your main subject. Normally, the main subject is in clear focus and the background is not. You will want to practice the technique. It is not all that easy sometimes, but you will like the results when you get a good motion panning capture. :)', '2007-01-17 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
