(3247127, 453933, 68586, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a beautiful bird. The question for me is whether it shows motion panning or motion capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a beautiful bird. The question for me is whether it shows motion panning or motion capture.', '2007-01-17 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247137, 453930, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love the image. Probably shows too much motion blur for the challenge though.</td>', 'Love the image. Probably shows too much motion blur for the challenge though.', '2007-01-17 14:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247139, 452625, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image showing a lot of motion. I''d like to know how you did it. True motion panning is steadily holding the camera while you twist your body to capture the main subject in focus while the background shows the natural motion that occurs during the exposure. This looks like the camera was moving with the cyclist and not panned. The hair is in good focus indicating a very short exposure time. The only way I can conceive of this happening is panning expertly with a long focal length lens from a great distance from the subject. If you did it that way then you did an incredible job!</td>', 'This is a nice image showing a lot of motion. I''d like to know how you did it. True motion panning is steadily holding the camera while you twist your body to capture the main subject in focus while the background shows the natural motion that occurs during the exposure. This looks like the camera was moving with the cyclist and not panned. The hair is in good focus indicating a very short exposure time. The only way I can conceive of this happening is panning expertly with a long focal length lens from a great distance from the subject. If you did it that way then you did an incredible job!', '2007-01-17 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3247140, 454129, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry - I just don''t know what these are and the title doesn''t help me. It''s hard to say if it conveys ''motion panning'' if you can''t make out what the subject is.</td>', 'I''m sorry - I just don''t know what these are and the title doesn''t help me. It''s hard to say if it conveys ''motion panning'' if you can''t make out what the subject is.', '2007-01-17 14:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
