(3247273, 454194, 72281, '<td valign="top">Intresting twist to capture motion of a heavy object coming towards you. The bus behind the truck lends it extra weight, and the focus on the right headlight gives the impression of it looking right at you. I like the tones just dark enough to make the yellow toplights pop, and the play of colors from green, blue red and purple. Texture also comes across as a play of fuzzy concrete and shiny metal. The zooming background has dynamism  with the curving siderails. Great pic!</td>', 'Intresting twist to capture motion of a heavy object coming towards you. The bus behind the truck lends it extra weight, and the focus on the right headlight gives the impression of it looking right at you. I like the tones just dark enough to make the yellow toplights pop, and the play of colors from green, blue red and purple. Texture also comes across as a play of fuzzy concrete and shiny metal. The zooming background has dynamism  with the curving siderails. Great pic!', '2007-01-17 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
