(3247773, 453974, 70298, '<td valign="top">Amazin shot, well done. Gr8 colours &amp; well fitted to the criteria. One of the best!</td>', 'Amazin shot, well done. Gr8 colours & well fitted to the criteria. One of the best!', '2007-01-17 16:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
