(3248773, 450965, 47541, '<td valign="top">Motion panning is not the same thing as motion blur.  The idea of panning is that the camera moves to keep the subject at the same point in the frame.  Having the camera attached to the subject isn''t quite the same thing ;)</td>', 'Motion panning is not the same thing as motion blur.  The idea of panning is that the camera moves to keep the subject at the same point in the frame.  Having the camera attached to the subject isn''t quite the same thing ;)', '2007-01-17 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
