(3249426, 453584, 31002, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the background in this picture or not.  I think a similar one would have made this a bit better for me.  I like the contrasting color between the foreground and background, but one minute i feel that i like the complexity of the background versus the simplicity of the foregrounf, but the other minute i feel that the complexity of the background buildings takes too much away from the subject...</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the background in this picture or not.  I think a similar one would have made this a bit better for me.  I like the contrasting color between the foreground and background, but one minute i feel that i like the complexity of the background versus the simplicity of the foregrounf, but the other minute i feel that the complexity of the background buildings takes too much away from the subject...', '2007-01-17 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
