(3249709, 454194, 39349, '<td valign="top">IMO this isn''t motion panning, it''s just a blurry photo. A good motion panning shot will have the subject in focus and the background blurred to enhance the subject. Good effort however. 5</td>', 'IMO this isn''t motion panning, it''s just a blurry photo. A good motion panning shot will have the subject in focus and the background blurred to enhance the subject. Good effort however. 5', '2007-01-18 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
