(3250791, 453560, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great timing and a very nice capture. Had they been looking right at you would have made this an amazing pic but still very nice as it is. 7</td>', 'Great timing and a very nice capture. Had they been looking right at you would have made this an amazing pic but still very nice as it is. 7', '2007-01-18 08:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250795, 454311, 53147, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see a good city taxi shot. Great colors and cool streaks. Has a Pawdrix type feel to it that I really really like. Bumping up to 8 for now.</td>', 'I was hoping to see a good city taxi shot. Great colors and cool streaks. Has a Pawdrix type feel to it that I really really like. Bumping up to 8 for now.', '2007-01-18 08:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250798, 452393, 28261, '<td valign="top">Subject was not tracked well.  The motion of the subject in addition to the background takes on the appearance of camera shake instead of intended motion blur.<br/> <br/>( 1 )</td>', 'Subject was not tracked well.  The motion of the subject in addition to the background takes on the appearance of camera shake instead of intended motion blur. ( 1 )', '2007-01-18 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250800, 453974, 53147, '<td valign="top">Now that just looks silly - the car not the image. And the title made me laugh. Cool shot. 7 for now</td>', 'Now that just looks silly - the car not the image. And the title made me laugh. Cool shot. 7 for now', '2007-01-18 08:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250807, 452702, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Good job of panning and stopping motion. Preferred crop would have been only superkid...that would have had some real punch!</td>', 'Nice capture.  Good job of panning and stopping motion. Preferred crop would have been only superkid...that would have had some real punch!', '2007-01-18 08:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250825, 453275, 28261, '<td valign="top">I cannot tell what it is about this image that ''went wrong...''  It appears extremely overexposed as well as oversharpened.  A good job of stopping motion, however the subject appears ready to drive off the picture, instead of driving into the image, which is considered a poor composition choice.</td>', 'I cannot tell what it is about this image that ''went wrong...''  It appears extremely overexposed as well as oversharpened.  A good job of stopping motion, however the subject appears ready to drive off the picture, instead of driving into the image, which is considered a poor composition choice.', '2007-01-18 08:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250833, 453351, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the subject (not centered.  Unfortunately a fairly uninteresting subject (not enough action?) and the panning is not tracked well enough to stop the motion of the subject.</td>', 'Good placement of the subject (not centered.  Unfortunately a fairly uninteresting subject (not enough action?) and the panning is not tracked well enough to stop the motion of the subject.', '2007-01-18 09:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250839, 454311, 28261, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Nice job of stopping motion in the window of the taxi.  Brilliant colors, great placement/size of subject compared to the rest of the image.  Has a nice punch factor - image stands out well.  Nice finesse.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Nice job of stopping motion in the window of the taxi.  Brilliant colors, great placement/size of subject compared to the rest of the image.  Has a nice punch factor - image stands out well.  Nice finesse.', '2007-01-18 09:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250857, 452479, 28261, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and placement of subject.  Nice coloration, although appears a bit muted.  Great stop motion and focus.</td>', 'Excellent capture and placement of subject.  Nice coloration, although appears a bit muted.  Great stop motion and focus.', '2007-01-18 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250880, 454151, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the stop motion/tracking of the head and placement of the subject.  Coloration is unfortunate and takes away from the impact the image could have had if the water had been a brilliant blue.</td>', 'Nice job on the stop motion/tracking of the head and placement of the subject.  Coloration is unfortunate and takes away from the impact the image could have had if the water had been a brilliant blue.', '2007-01-18 09:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250883, 454204, 18219, '<td valign="top">the amount of blur on the dog probably won''t go down too well with most of the voters, but I think it works well.<br/>maybe too artsy for this challenge though.</td>', 'the amount of blur on the dog probably won''t go down too well with most of the voters, but I think it works well.maybe too artsy for this challenge though.', '2007-01-18 09:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250887, 453480, 18219, '<td valign="top">clever title and good capture for the challenge.<br/>It may prove to be a bit too cutsie for most of the DPC crowd though!!!!</td>', 'clever title and good capture for the challenge.It may prove to be a bit too cutsie for most of the DPC crowd though!!!!', '2007-01-18 09:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250892, 454255, 18219, '<td valign="top">not bad.<br/>It would have been nice to have seen some other players in te background as he "zoomed" by them.</td>', 'not bad.It would have been nice to have seen some other players in te background as he "zoomed" by them.', '2007-01-18 09:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250893, 453968, 28261, '<td valign="top">Tilted perspective adds something to this image.  Gives it the feel of speed, going downhill.  Motion tracking was a bit off, leaving subject blurry like camera shake.  Great finishing work and clarity/cleanness of picture.</td>', 'Tilted perspective adds something to this image.  Gives it the feel of speed, going downhill.  Motion tracking was a bit off, leaving subject blurry like camera shake.  Great finishing work and clarity/cleanness of picture.', '2007-01-18 09:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250895, 454212, 18219, '<td valign="top">good panning.</td>', 'good panning.', '2007-01-18 09:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250912, 452506, 28261, '<td valign="top">Colors are muted and shadowed heavily.  Image subject is not interesting.<br/> <br/>Not motion panning -- this is long exposure.  <br/>The environment is stationary.  The subjects are blurred (in motion).  To achieve motion panning, you should have a slow exposure and be tracking a moving subject so that you stop the motion of the subject and blur the background, leaving the impression of action (often fast action).</td>', 'Colors are muted and shadowed heavily.  Image subject is not interesting. Not motion panning -- this is long exposure.  The environment is stationary.  The subjects are blurred (in motion).  To achieve motion panning, you should have a slow exposure and be tracking a moving subject so that you stop the motion of the subject and blur the background, leaving the impression of action (often fast action).', '2007-01-18 09:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250919, 452218, 28261, '<td valign="top">Not enough subject, too much environment.<br/>Good job of stopping motion.  Little too much sharpen (jaggies)<br/>Nice colors on Train.  Rest of image is really dull and take a lot away.</td>', 'Not enough subject, too much environment.Good job of stopping motion.  Little too much sharpen (jaggies)Nice colors on Train.  Rest of image is really dull and take a lot away.', '2007-01-18 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250926, 451234, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion and tracking of subject.<br/>Placement of subject moving out of image throws the whole balance of the picture off and the dark vs light horizon, makes the image appear tilted in just the wrong direction as well.  The duck''s coloration blends too much with the river''s shadows.<br/>Great Tracking - Poor Image.</td>', 'Good stop motion and tracking of subject.Placement of subject moving out of image throws the whole balance of the picture off and the dark vs light horizon, makes the image appear tilted in just the wrong direction as well.  The duck''s coloration blends too much with the river''s shadows.Great Tracking - Poor Image.', '2007-01-18 09:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250932, 454194, 28261, '<td valign="top">Tough angle for motion panning/tracking subject.  While some stop motion was achieved, the subject still appears too blurred and the result is an image that looks more like it suffers from camera shake combined with slow shutter, instead of an intended effect.</td>', 'Tough angle for motion panning/tracking subject.  While some stop motion was achieved, the subject still appears too blurred and the result is an image that looks more like it suffers from camera shake combined with slow shutter, instead of an intended effect.', '2007-01-18 09:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250933, 454307, 15711, '<td valign="top">I sense this as more motion blur than pan. I''d like to see one of the cars in focus to differentiate the background from foreground.</td>', 'I sense this as more motion blur than pan. I''d like to see one of the cars in focus to differentiate the background from foreground.', '2007-01-18 09:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250937, 453807, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The skateboarder is focused and all of the rest of the activity is behind him, suiting the challenge well.</td>', 'I like this alot.  The skateboarder is focused and all of the rest of the activity is behind him, suiting the challenge well.', '2007-01-18 09:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250951, 452915, 18219, '<td valign="top">not a bad picture.<br/>well executed.<br/>and fits the challenge.<br/>on the down side, it just doesn''t do much for me as a picture.<br/>I''m not sure why.<br/>Maybe it''s because I''m not into skating?<br/>Sorry.</td>', 'not a bad picture.well executed.and fits the challenge.on the down side, it just doesn''t do much for me as a picture.I''m not sure why.Maybe it''s because I''m not into skating?Sorry.', '2007-01-18 09:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250954, 453981, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good tracking.  Nice close crop.  Has nice punch.<br/>Artistic Punch - Nil<br/>Would make a good addition to the family album.</td>', 'Good tracking.  Nice close crop.  Has nice punch.Artistic Punch - NilWould make a good addition to the family album.', '2007-01-18 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250964, 451738, 28261, '<td valign="top">Really nice job of tracking and additional effects (water splash).  Centered composition leaves this image lacking slightly as there is a minor question of what direction the ball is going in.  Without the splash, this would be very bad. Would like to see a crop where the ball is slightly lower in the frame.</td>', 'Really nice job of tracking and additional effects (water splash).  Centered composition leaves this image lacking slightly as there is a minor question of what direction the ball is going in.  Without the splash, this would be very bad. Would like to see a crop where the ball is slightly lower in the frame.', '2007-01-18 09:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250966, 451348, 18219, '<td valign="top">a good sense of movement.<br/>and I like the STOP sign in the background.<br/>It''s a pity he wasn''t totally in focus though.</td>', 'a good sense of movement.and I like the STOP sign in the background.It''s a pity he wasn''t totally in focus though.', '2007-01-18 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250975, 452509, 18219, '<td valign="top">I suppose the crop is close on the swimmer to eliminate the other entrants in the race?<br/>But I think the inclusion of others would serve well to give the race more meaning.<br/>Also, it seems a bit "claustrophobic" in the frame.<br/>The old adage of "give the person some space to swim into" would work well here.</td>', 'I suppose the crop is close on the swimmer to eliminate the other entrants in the race?But I think the inclusion of others would serve well to give the race more meaning.Also, it seems a bit "claustrophobic" in the frame.The old adage of "give the person some space to swim into" would work well here.', '2007-01-18 09:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250978, 454307, 28261, '<td valign="top">Bad capture.  Image is too blurry because the subject is not tracked well.  On the night background, this destroys the image.</td>', 'Bad capture.  Image is too blurry because the subject is not tracked well.  On the night background, this destroys the image.', '2007-01-18 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3250979, 452702, 18219, '<td valign="top">the motion panning is certainly captured in this picture.<br/>And it had me looking at the picture for quite some time.<br/>But unfortunately not in a good way.<br/>I was trying to work out what I didn''t like about the picture!<br/>Sorry.<br/>Anyway, the best I could come up with is that it is just a picture of a couple of dudes doing silly tricks on motorbikes and that just doesn''t appeal to me.<br/>The background is good though :-)</td>', 'the motion panning is certainly captured in this picture.And it had me looking at the picture for quite some time.But unfortunately not in a good way.I was trying to work out what I didn''t like about the picture!Sorry.Anyway, the best I could come up with is that it is just a picture of a couple of dudes doing silly tricks on motorbikes and that just doesn''t appeal to me.The background is good though :-)', '2007-01-18 09:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251005, 454191, 18219, '<td valign="top">it''s a pity the legs are cut off below the knees.<br/>otherwise, a good effort.</td>', 'it''s a pity the legs are cut off below the knees.otherwise, a good effort.', '2007-01-18 10:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251008, 454079, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of expression and action.  Too bad this isn''t a bit wider and less centered.  I''d like to see the horse or springboard that she is running to.  Lots of noise on this one which is common indoors - a bit of neat image would take this picture a long way.</td>', 'Nice capture of expression and action.  Too bad this isn''t a bit wider and less centered.  I''d like to see the horse or springboard that she is running to.  Lots of noise on this one which is common indoors - a bit of neat image would take this picture a long way.', '2007-01-18 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251020, 454041, 18219, '<td valign="top">i like the title.<br/>and I quite like the picture.<br/>well done.</td>', 'i like the title.and I quite like the picture.well done.', '2007-01-18 10:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251023, 452766, 18219, '<td valign="top">the bright vibrant colors certainly make the rider stand out from the rest of the picture.<br/>well done.</td>', 'the bright vibrant colors certainly make the rider stand out from the rest of the picture.well done.', '2007-01-18 10:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251025, 454097, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice tracking to get stop motion.  Somewhat overexposed.  Image is snapshot quality due to framing.  Would have been much nicer to include entire car in this shot (place the action in it''s environment).  (Besides...this is a muscle car...make it shine!)</td>', 'Nice tracking to get stop motion.  Somewhat overexposed.  Image is snapshot quality due to framing.  Would have been much nicer to include entire car in this shot (place the action in it''s environment).  (Besides...this is a muscle car...make it shine!)', '2007-01-18 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251027, 453933, 18219, '<td valign="top">it has probably already been said, but I will say it anyway....this is a good capture of a bird in flight, but the background kust looks like bokeh rather than motion panning.<br/>and that could hurt your score.<br/>I should know, it''s hurting mine :-)</td>', 'it has probably already been said, but I will say it anyway....this is a good capture of a bird in flight, but the background kust looks like bokeh rather than motion panning.and that could hurt your score.I should know, it''s hurting mine :-)', '2007-01-18 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251032, 453742, 18219, '<td valign="top">there''s a great sense of movement within this picture.<br/>it almost makes me feel dizzy!!!!<br/>technically I''m not sure if it counts as motion panning though?<br/>but who cares eh?<br/>actually, probably lots of people.<br/>but not me!!!!<br/>i like the movement here.</td>', 'there''s a great sense of movement within this picture.it almost makes me feel dizzy!!!!technically I''m not sure if it counts as motion panning though?but who cares eh?actually, probably lots of people.but not me!!!!i like the movement here.', '2007-01-18 10:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251035, 452131, 18219, '<td valign="top">are they toys?<br/>nice motion panning either way.<br/>well done.</td>', 'are they toys?nice motion panning either way.well done.', '2007-01-18 10:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251037, 452335, 18219, '<td valign="top">the black and white is working very well here.<br/>for me anyway.</td>', 'the black and white is working very well here.for me anyway.', '2007-01-18 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251073, 453929, 49819, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is not a panning, just a poor shot</td>', 'Sorry but this is not a panning, just a poor shot', '2007-01-18 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251078, 453197, 28261, '<td valign="top">Image is not tracked well enough to stop motion, causing it to appear more like camera shake than motion panning for effect.</td>', 'Image is not tracked well enough to stop motion, causing it to appear more like camera shake than motion panning for effect.', '2007-01-18 10:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251103, 454254, 68685, '<td valign="top">That''s my dog with more hair!</td>', 'That''s my dog with more hair!', '2007-01-18 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251104, 453558, 28261, '<td valign="top">Motion tracked well and creates nice effect/focus, sharpness on subject.  Environment/crop not wide enough to really emphasize action and tilting of horizon seems to defeat the image''s effect.</td>', 'Motion tracked well and creates nice effect/focus, sharpness on subject.  Environment/crop not wide enough to really emphasize action and tilting of horizon seems to defeat the image''s effect.', '2007-01-18 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251107, 452938, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good job of motion tracking and creating stop motion.  Excellent subject contrast with other moving subject.  Image sharp/clear, but uninteresting.</td>', 'Good job of motion tracking and creating stop motion.  Excellent subject contrast with other moving subject.  Image sharp/clear, but uninteresting.', '2007-01-18 10:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251108, 453560, 18219, '<td valign="top">good panning.<br/>but i think it would have been better without the man in there.<br/>just my personal preference.</td>', 'good panning.but i think it would have been better without the man in there.just my personal preference.', '2007-01-18 10:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251113, 453737, 28261, '<td valign="top">Overexposure of image causes a real problem with blown highlights vying for attention loss of contrast in subject.  Slightly off track, causing a minor feeling of out of focus rather than stop motion.  Lots of challenges in this capture that really need strong panning/tracking and perfect exposure.</td>', 'Overexposure of image causes a real problem with blown highlights vying for attention loss of contrast in subject.  Slightly off track, causing a minor feeling of out of focus rather than stop motion.  Lots of challenges in this capture that really need strong panning/tracking and perfect exposure.', '2007-01-18 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251126, 450965, 31443, '<td valign="top">Luvvvvvvly!</td>', 'Luvvvvvvly!', '2007-01-18 10:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251127, 454276, 28261, '<td valign="top">The image''s potential for impact is lost on the complete lack of stop motion.  Too long an exposure gave the subject ample time to move and not be stopped in action.</td>', 'The image''s potential for impact is lost on the complete lack of stop motion.  Too long an exposure gave the subject ample time to move and not be stopped in action.', '2007-01-18 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3251138, 454271, 28261, '<td valign="top">Complete loss of stop motion probably due to too long an exposure.</td>', 'Complete loss of stop motion probably due to too long an exposure.', '2007-01-18 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251141, 453558, 68685, '<td valign="top">You know how the title loads first, then the photo...I had a different image in mind..:)</td>', 'You know how the title loads first, then the photo...I had a different image in mind..:)', '2007-01-18 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251144, 454041, 3569, '<td valign="top">Grebe...</td>', 'Grebe...', '2007-01-18 10:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251146, 454255, 28261, '<td valign="top">Appearance here is that you were tracking the puck which is solidly stopped in motion.  Unfortunately, the skater''s helmet is somewhat camera shook and detracts a bit from the impact.   Good image, wrong focal point imo.</td>', 'Appearance here is that you were tracking the puck which is solidly stopped in motion.  Unfortunately, the skater''s helmet is somewhat camera shook and detracts a bit from the impact.   Good image, wrong focal point imo.', '2007-01-18 10:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251154, 453191, 31443, '<td valign="top">Out of box, great colors, yummie looking....</td>', 'Out of box, great colors, yummie looking....', '2007-01-18 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251155, 452509, 28261, '<td valign="top">Excellent tracking, especially at angle of movement that is not straight on.  Exposure time just right to catch and communicate action, but not lose the environment''s detail completely.</td>', 'Excellent tracking, especially at angle of movement that is not straight on.  Exposure time just right to catch and communicate action, but not lose the environment''s detail completely.', '2007-01-18 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251163, 454307, 31443, '<td valign="top">The pan is good but the car should be in better focus...great colors though.</td>', 'The pan is good but the car should be in better focus...great colors though.', '2007-01-18 10:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251165, 452625, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good addition to family album.  Bit overexposed and would have had much more impact if the transportation had been included in an ''action'' shot as opposed to a ''hey I''m moving so you can take my picture'' pose.  Nice tracking vs environment.</td>', 'Good addition to family album.  Bit overexposed and would have had much more impact if the transportation had been included in an ''action'' shot as opposed to a ''hey I''m moving so you can take my picture'' pose.  Nice tracking vs environment.', '2007-01-18 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251170, 452702, 69882, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture,</td>', 'Very cool picture,', '2007-01-18 11:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251177, 452635, 28261, '<td valign="top">Image exposure is muddy, not enough light.  Tracking is slightly off leaving impression of camera shake.  Open F stop a bit more or up the ISO.  Pan smoothly with subject and keep moving while shutter opens.</td>', 'Image exposure is muddy, not enough light.  Tracking is slightly off leaving impression of camera shake.  Open F stop a bit more or up the ISO.  Pan smoothly with subject and keep moving while shutter opens.', '2007-01-18 11:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251178, 453967, 18219, '<td valign="top">my favorite so far.<br/>i''m only a quarter of the way through voting, so don''t get too excited.<br/>But at least you have something different going on here.<br/>good luck.</td>', 'my favorite so far.i''m only a quarter of the way through voting, so don''t get too excited.But at least you have something different going on here.good luck.', '2007-01-18 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251182, 452335, 28261, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough exposure time on this one.  Appears to be more lack of DOF type blurring, than motion panning.  Horse is obviously in motion, but the background is not what translates this to me. Nice sharp image and good quality tones.</td>', 'Not quite enough exposure time on this one.  Appears to be more lack of DOF type blurring, than motion panning.  Horse is obviously in motion, but the background is not what translates this to me. Nice sharp image and good quality tones.', '2007-01-18 11:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251187, 453868, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice timing for exposure.  Background translates movement well. Tracking the horse''s head instead of the rider has caused the rider''s form to appear affected by camera shake and this image would have been more appealing to me to have the horse somewhat in motion with the rider and lance as sharp as possible.  Great choice of subject!</td>', 'Nice timing for exposure.  Background translates movement well. Tracking the horse''s head instead of the rider has caused the rider''s form to appear affected by camera shake and this image would have been more appealing to me to have the horse somewhat in motion with the rider and lance as sharp as possible.  Great choice of subject!', '2007-01-18 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251196, 453929, 28261, '<td valign="top">Subject is stationary as is environment.  Other moving subjects are blurred.  This is not motion panning, this is long exposure.  Focus on a moving target and pan the camera with that subject, opening the shutter and continuing to move with the main focus.  This causes the environment to blur giving a real sense of action.</td>', 'Subject is stationary as is environment.  Other moving subjects are blurred.  This is not motion panning, this is long exposure.  Focus on a moving target and pan the camera with that subject, opening the shutter and continuing to move with the main focus.  This causes the environment to blur giving a real sense of action.', '2007-01-18 11:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251227, 453273, 28261, '<td valign="top">Exposure time seems too short, while ISO or Fstop seems too open.  Thus, results are that the motion blur of the background has too much bokeh and not enough motion and the subject/environment is overexposed.</td>', 'Exposure time seems too short, while ISO or Fstop seems too open.  Thus, results are that the motion blur of the background has too much bokeh and not enough motion and the subject/environment is overexposed.', '2007-01-18 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251230, 454212, 28261, '<td valign="top">Great job of framing this in its environment.  Tough panning on this kind of angle.  Subject suffers slightly from camera shake but overall a great effort.</td>', 'Great job of framing this in its environment.  Tough panning on this kind of angle.  Subject suffers slightly from camera shake but overall a great effort.', '2007-01-18 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251268, 454002, 28261, '<td valign="top">Great Job with using black and white.  Exposure perfect and contrast works well against background.  Good placement of subject.  Bit grainy, but acceptable.<br/>Excellent job.</td>', 'Great Job with using black and white.  Exposure perfect and contrast works well against background.  Good placement of subject.  Bit grainy, but acceptable.Excellent job.', '2007-01-18 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251290, 454191, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good panning creates good stop motion - nice capture.  <br/>Exposure is not long enough to give good lighting or feeling of fast motion, leaving the image dull and without adrenaline.</td>', 'Good panning creates good stop motion - nice capture.  Exposure is not long enough to give good lighting or feeling of fast motion, leaving the image dull and without adrenaline.', '2007-01-18 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251299, 451993, 28261, '<td valign="top">Motion Blur here is defeated by the use of flash and the murkiness of the background.  The exposure time is long enough to create the effect, however the subject appears camera shook.</td>', 'Motion Blur here is defeated by the use of flash and the murkiness of the background.  The exposure time is long enough to create the effect, however the subject appears camera shook.', '2007-01-18 11:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251308, 453922, 28261, '<td valign="top">Use of monochrome here causes the trampoline to look like just another wall in the background, orphaning the subject in empty air.  This is a great capture, subject is well tracked, and in focus, detail is sharp and placement in image crop is well done.<br/> <br/>Should have left this one color.</td>', 'Use of monochrome here causes the trampoline to look like just another wall in the background, orphaning the subject in empty air.  This is a great capture, subject is well tracked, and in focus, detail is sharp and placement in image crop is well done. Should have left this one color.', '2007-01-18 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251314, 452607, 28261, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of TWO moving subjects and panning/tracking is spot on.  Coloration of water and background are nice contrast to the white of the birds and placement of subject is perfect for the action.<br/> <br/>Brilliant!</td>', 'Excellent capture of TWO moving subjects and panning/tracking is spot on.  Coloration of water and background are nice contrast to the white of the birds and placement of subject is perfect for the action. Brilliant!', '2007-01-18 11:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251318, 453023, 28261, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened here, but image appears distorted rather than motion blurred.  Image background has seriously hurt the impact of the capture as it is mostly blown highlights and vie directly for attention.</td>', 'Not sure what happened here, but image appears distorted rather than motion blurred.  Image background has seriously hurt the impact of the capture as it is mostly blown highlights and vie directly for attention.', '2007-01-18 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251328, 454088, 28261, '<td valign="top">Motion Capture = Great.  Nice focus, nice stop motion on subject, good quality of blur in background.<br/>Subject is on the way out of the image, but on a downhill slope, this is not unbalanced.  A decent capture.</td>', 'Motion Capture = Great.  Nice focus, nice stop motion on subject, good quality of blur in background.Subject is on the way out of the image, but on a downhill slope, this is not unbalanced.  A decent capture.', '2007-01-18 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251336, 454350, 28261, '<td valign="top">Matchbox or Hot Wheels?<br/> <br/>Good Tracking.  Use of miniature on simulated environment defeats a lot of the impact of motion.  You do have some camera shake going on here too.  Because the miniature is moving faster (relatively) due to size, your pan speed needs to be very fast and right on mark to pull this off.  The top down angle, compared to a more side view really makes it apparent that this is mocked up.</td>', 'Matchbox or Hot Wheels? Good Tracking.  Use of miniature on simulated environment defeats a lot of the impact of motion.  You do have some camera shake going on here too.  Because the miniature is moving faster (relatively) due to size, your pan speed needs to be very fast and right on mark to pull this off.  The top down angle, compared to a more side view really makes it apparent that this is mocked up.', '2007-01-18 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251339, 453819, 63163, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a little too soft.  Still a nice capture.</td>', 'The colors seem a little too soft.  Still a nice capture.', '2007-01-18 12:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3251340, 452869, 28261, '<td valign="top">Great capture, Great Tracking on the helmet or headlight.  Motion blur of background is long enough to really give an extreme sense of speed, but still hint at cars, buildings, city to leave the subject in his environ.<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Great capture, Great Tracking on the helmet or headlight.  Motion blur of background is long enough to really give an extreme sense of speed, but still hint at cars, buildings, city to leave the subject in his environ. Great job.', '2007-01-18 12:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
