(3258526, 454204, 40155, '<td valign="top">Running animals are difficult because most of their body moves all the time.  Try to pick something that moves but has the potential to be still long enough for a clear focus, not perfect just strong enough to be identifyable.</td>', 'Running animals are difficult because most of their body moves all the time.  Try to pick something that moves but has the potential to be still long enough for a clear focus, not perfect just strong enough to be identifyable.', '2007-01-20 01:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
