(3261114, 451225, 50695, '<td valign="top">Is there a motion pan effect here? I''m not sure, but I love the intimacy of this picture. <br/> <br/>My Daddy''s a Road<br/> <br/>My Daddy''s a road.<br/>I walk him to the school.<br/>I ride him to work.<br/>I put my thumb over him.<br/>I dream of him, <br/>of where he converges<br/>in reddening light.<br/> <br/>My Daddy''s a street.<br/>I cross him. I leave<br/>in his gutters<br/>crumpled-up ideas.<br/>I pull on him<br/>and off him, I park<br/>at his side, I ignore <br/>his signs. I forget<br/>the lead I took from him.<br/>I long for his forever open arms <br/>to close on me.<br/> <br/> <br/>Well, dang, you gave me a poem so I better give you a 10.</td>', 'Is there a motion pan effect here? I''m not sure, but I love the intimacy of this picture.  My Daddy''s a Road My Daddy''s a road.I walk him to the school.I ride him to work.I put my thumb over him.I dream of him, of where he convergesin reddening light. My Daddy''s a street.I cross him. I leavein his gutterscrumpled-up ideas.I pull on himand off him, I parkat his side, I ignore his signs. I forgetthe lead I took from him.I long for his forever open arms to close on me.  Well, dang, you gave me a poem so I better give you a 10.', '2007-01-20 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
