(3261579, 453933, 49969, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool shot. But i can''t reall see that it''s the result of panning (the wings are too sharp for one). It looks just like shallow DoF.</td>', 'It''s a cool shot. But i can''t reall see that it''s the result of panning (the wings are too sharp for one). It looks just like shallow DoF.', '2007-01-21 04:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
