(3261583, 453281, 53964, '<td valign="top">DOF is just a little too shallow to capture both birds sharply. She''s beautifully clear, ''twould be lovely if he were the same :)<br/>IMO, having the subjects left of center may have given an even stronger impression of movement, as if they had just entered the frame and were on their way across it, actually moving as we watch. Does that make sense? <br/>The background colours are lovely :)</td>', 'DOF is just a little too shallow to capture both birds sharply. She''s beautifully clear, ''twould be lovely if he were the same :)IMO, having the subjects left of center may have given an even stronger impression of movement, as if they had just entered the frame and were on their way across it, actually moving as we watch. Does that make sense? The background colours are lovely :)', '2007-01-21 04:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3261584, 453743, 49969, '<td valign="top">i like the vivid colours and the painting quality of this picture.</td>', 'i like the vivid colours and the painting quality of this picture.', '2007-01-21 04:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
