(3267490, 452788, 27605, '<td valign="top">Good effort but in my opinion this doesn''t meet the challenge because the background isn''t blurred from panning the camera.  Also the shot itself lacks a focal point... looking at the gap between the cars I feel the need to merge :o)  Hope you find these comments helpful.</td>', 'Good effort but in my opinion this doesn''t meet the challenge because the background isn''t blurred from panning the camera.  Also the shot itself lacks a focal point... looking at the gap between the cars I feel the need to merge :o)  Hope you find these comments helpful.', '2007-01-22 16:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
