(3267545, 452479, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of motion panning. My only problem? Well so many people did the bike thing, hey I did too in the original motion panning challenge and scored high. You can see it in my portfolio. I like that you got the blur from him moving too, shot at about a 60th of a second I bet. Maybe 30th.</td>', 'This is a great example of motion panning. My only problem? Well so many people did the bike thing, hey I did too in the original motion panning challenge and scored high. You can see it in my portfolio. I like that you got the blur from him moving too, shot at about a 60th of a second I bet. Maybe 30th.', '2007-01-22 16:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267553, 454318, 40819, '<td valign="top">Excellent work and different too. However I would guess you were standstill on the merry go round not panning. Nice shot anyway though.</td>', 'Excellent work and different too. However I would guess you were standstill on the merry go round not panning. Nice shot anyway though.', '2007-01-22 16:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
