(3267564, 453273, 40819, '<td valign="top">I would guess you shot this at 250th or 125th of a second, too fast to get the blured background of a good motion panning shot. Keep trying though.</td>', 'I would guess you shot this at 250th or 125th of a second, too fast to get the blured background of a good motion panning shot. Keep trying though.', '2007-01-22 16:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267566, 453278, 40819, '<td valign="top">Good one.</td>', 'Good one.', '2007-01-22 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267569, 453623, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not motion panning but interestingly good.</td>', 'Not motion panning but interestingly good.', '2007-01-22 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267590, 453577, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is blurry because the subject is moving not the camera so you were not panning so it isn''t really fit for the challenge, it is a cute picture though.</td>', 'This is blurry because the subject is moving not the camera so you were not panning so it isn''t really fit for the challenge, it is a cute picture though.', '2007-01-22 16:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267592, 453742, 40819, '<td valign="top">Another great image but not motion panning.</td>', 'Another great image but not motion panning.', '2007-01-22 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267605, 453560, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is a great motion panning shot. There was another of a horse on a merry go round but it was shot on the moving merry go round, thus not motion panning. This however is such a warm and welcoming shot panning as the boy and his dad pass, so good I think so far this is my favorite.</td>', 'This is a great motion panning shot. There was another of a horse on a merry go round but it was shot on the moving merry go round, thus not motion panning. This however is such a warm and welcoming shot panning as the boy and his dad pass, so good I think so far this is my favorite.', '2007-01-22 16:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267620, 451225, 40819, '<td valign="top">Oh how can I say anything bad about this? Well it is a great and warm idea for an image. Motion panning? Don''t think so. I would love to shoot this again and get the dad crystal clear and then enter this into a farther''s day challenge. So cute those little feet.</td>', 'Oh how can I say anything bad about this? Well it is a great and warm idea for an image. Motion panning? Don''t think so. I would love to shoot this again and get the dad crystal clear and then enter this into a farther''s day challenge. So cute those little feet.', '2007-01-22 16:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267627, 454109, 40819, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I boubt you panned a moving bullet and just happened to capture it in a motion panning way. I could be wrong. Great shot though.</td>', 'Nice shot but I boubt you panned a moving bullet and just happened to capture it in a motion panning way. I could be wrong. Great shot though.', '2007-01-22 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267644, 454088, 40819, '<td valign="top">So many bikes, so little 10''s. Sorry I am just getting tired of bike shots. It will not be reflected in your score. Good effort to capture the challenge.</td>', 'So many bikes, so little 10''s. Sorry I am just getting tired of bike shots. It will not be reflected in your score. Good effort to capture the challenge.', '2007-01-22 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
