(3270815, 453577, 27605, '<td valign="top">I think this misses the mark by having the subject blurred and the background relatively sharp; it is my understanding that the challenge is to do the opposite.  Hope this is a helpful comment.<br/> <br/>Looks like she''s having a good time though :o)</td>', 'I think this misses the mark by having the subject blurred and the background relatively sharp; it is my understanding that the challenge is to do the opposite.  Hope this is a helpful comment. Looks like she''s having a good time though :o)', '2007-01-23 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
