(3271165, 453757, 52449, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. However, if there were more space in front of the car than in the rear, I would have given you another point or two. Having more space in front gives the viewer more of a sense of movement into the space.</td>', 'Cool shot. However, if there were more space in front of the car than in the rear, I would have given you another point or two. Having more space in front gives the viewer more of a sense of movement into the space.', '2007-01-23 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
