(3271358, 453552, 34938, '<td valign="top">i would have cropped out the legs in the bg and this would have been perfect for the challenge...like this, it''s more of a snapshot...taking out the legs (try it and see) will add so much more drama and impact</td>', 'i would have cropped out the legs in the bg and this would have been perfect for the challenge...like this, it''s more of a snapshot...taking out the legs (try it and see) will add so much more drama and impact', '2007-01-23 15:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271360, 453974, 34938, '<td valign="top">good title for a great shot</td>', 'good title for a great shot', '2007-01-23 15:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271370, 453584, 34938, '<td valign="top">I really like this...the rare thing is a sunny London Day...archive this quick!!!<br/> <br/>Actually a good image that suits the challenge</td>', 'I really like this...the rare thing is a sunny London Day...archive this quick!!! Actually a good image that suits the challenge', '2007-01-23 15:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
