(3271448, 452788, 34938, '<td valign="top">???? motion panning????</td>', '???? motion panning????', '2007-01-23 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271463, 453604, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the desat and the contrast of the image...</td>', 'I love the desat and the contrast of the image...', '2007-01-23 16:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271468, 453439, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the drama here...nice light and dark...I really like this</td>', 'I love the drama here...nice light and dark...I really like this', '2007-01-23 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271510, 453742, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this image (I like photos taken from vehicles; it''s where we spend a lot of our lives, and if someone can show me something different from that perspective, I''m all for it). Still, I don''t really buy it as a motion panning shot, and I''m trying to be pretty technical on that to keep things even across the shots here. In terms of what''s here, I feel a bit off-balance when I look at it. Maybe that was the point, but rotating just a bit counter-clockwise -- but not too much ;) -- might have left me a bit more at ease with it.</td>', 'I like this image (I like photos taken from vehicles; it''s where we spend a lot of our lives, and if someone can show me something different from that perspective, I''m all for it). Still, I don''t really buy it as a motion panning shot, and I''m trying to be pretty technical on that to keep things even across the shots here. In terms of what''s here, I feel a bit off-balance when I look at it. Maybe that was the point, but rotating just a bit counter-clockwise -- but not too much ;) -- might have left me a bit more at ease with it.', '2007-01-23 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271522, 454109, 43073, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what to think of this; I like it, but I didn''t get a feeling of motion from it. While the subject is in sharp focus and I know what it is, and likely that it was moving very, very fast (and am intrigued with how you captured it), I still don''t buy it as a motion panning shot (stop action, maybe), but without a distinct background, the motion panning aspect is lost on me.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what to think of this; I like it, but I didn''t get a feeling of motion from it. While the subject is in sharp focus and I know what it is, and likely that it was moving very, very fast (and am intrigued with how you captured it), I still don''t buy it as a motion panning shot (stop action, maybe), but without a distinct background, the motion panning aspect is lost on me.', '2007-01-23 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271526, 453539, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image does not do much for me, and I don''t see the motion panning aspect. The light creates a haze in front of the model, but with the expression on her face and the composition of the image, I don''t feel movement at all.</td>', 'This image does not do much for me, and I don''t see the motion panning aspect. The light creates a haze in front of the model, but with the expression on her face and the composition of the image, I don''t feel movement at all.', '2007-01-23 16:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271533, 454276, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but it either looks like long or multiple exposures, not motion panning (the backround is light, but not exactly blurred). As an image (challenge aside), I like the color of the bicycle, but that seems to be the main focus. I can''t find anything else to really focus on or that draws my eye; if something in the image had been the clear subject, it would have been easier for me to take, I think.</td>', 'Interesting image, but it either looks like long or multiple exposures, not motion panning (the backround is light, but not exactly blurred). As an image (challenge aside), I like the color of the bicycle, but that seems to be the main focus. I can''t find anything else to really focus on or that draws my eye; if something in the image had been the clear subject, it would have been easier for me to take, I think.', '2007-01-23 16:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271548, 451225, 43073, '<td valign="top">The motion panning is lost on me here, but it''s still a nice image. I can see the attempt to get motion blur, but having the dad''s face in sharp focus (leaving the motion blur to the feet), with perhaps a bit more contrast in the whole image, would have improved it for me a bit.</td>', 'The motion panning is lost on me here, but it''s still a nice image. I can see the attempt to get motion blur, but having the dad''s face in sharp focus (leaving the motion blur to the feet), with perhaps a bit more contrast in the whole image, would have improved it for me a bit.', '2007-01-23 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271565, 452506, 43073, '<td valign="top">There was something about this image that I liked, but I can''t really put my finger on it; maybe the contrast of the pretty sharp right wall with the blurred dancers and the play of the light. Even so, I can''t really identify the motion panning aspect; the primary subjects are all blurred, and my eye always seemed to be looking for something else.</td>', 'There was something about this image that I liked, but I can''t really put my finger on it; maybe the contrast of the pretty sharp right wall with the blurred dancers and the play of the light. Even so, I can''t really identify the motion panning aspect; the primary subjects are all blurred, and my eye always seemed to be looking for something else.', '2007-01-23 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271576, 454129, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t work for me; the motion panning is lost on my eyes, and I would have liked to have seen it with more contrast. As for what''s here, it evoked a feeling of a foggy wartime beach scene in my mind, even once I realized they were jacks, and the composition is nice, even if the image is not technically very strong.</td>', 'This image doesn''t work for me; the motion panning is lost on my eyes, and I would have liked to have seen it with more contrast. As for what''s here, it evoked a feeling of a foggy wartime beach scene in my mind, even once I realized they were jacks, and the composition is nice, even if the image is not technically very strong.', '2007-01-23 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271582, 454219, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting, nice use of colors, but does not do much for me beyond that, and I''m not seeing a connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting, nice use of colors, but does not do much for me beyond that, and I''m not seeing a connection to the challenge.', '2007-01-23 16:40:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3271602, 451830, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like these kinds of images, but it''s not really the technique that was asked for in the challenge. As for what is here, the rider''s face looks to me like it was oversharpened (could also be a contrast issue), and the clouds looked a bit too blue to my eyes, as well.</td>', 'I like these kinds of images, but it''s not really the technique that was asked for in the challenge. As for what is here, the rider''s face looks to me like it was oversharpened (could also be a contrast issue), and the clouds looked a bit too blue to my eyes, as well.', '2007-01-23 16:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271611, 453737, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good image, with reasonable clarity given the circumstances, but it''s hard to get motion panning with water as a background, and while I know the waterskier here is in motion, I don''t get a feeling of motion from the photo. The water at his feet is also very bright, though honestly I''m not sure you could have done anything about that.</td>', 'Good image, with reasonable clarity given the circumstances, but it''s hard to get motion panning with water as a background, and while I know the waterskier here is in motion, I don''t get a feeling of motion from the photo. The water at his feet is also very bright, though honestly I''m not sure you could have done anything about that.', '2007-01-23 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271616, 454036, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting image to look at, though I don''t see the use of the motion panning technique in it (marked it down for that, sorry); I am very curious how it was done, and I like the constant shade of blue that runs throughout it.</td>', 'This is a really interesting image to look at, though I don''t see the use of the motion panning technique in it (marked it down for that, sorry); I am very curious how it was done, and I like the constant shade of blue that runs throughout it.', '2007-01-23 16:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271621, 453191, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really nice effect, but it conveys to me something more like electricity in the water than it does motion; one of the really good images I''ve seen this challenge that has good elements (good use of color, interesting to look at) but that doesn''t really seem (to my eyes) to use the technique called for in the challenge.</td>', 'Really nice effect, but it conveys to me something more like electricity in the water than it does motion; one of the really good images I''ve seen this challenge that has good elements (good use of color, interesting to look at) but that doesn''t really seem (to my eyes) to use the technique called for in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 16:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271671, 453929, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat image, showing motion, with interesting composition (though I think I either would have included a bit more at the top, or a bit less - the half included words are a bit distracting to me (how''s that for picky). Not sure how it fits with the challenge (the motion is in the wrong subject for me, and I went lower for that, sorry), but I still like it.</td>', 'Neat image, showing motion, with interesting composition (though I think I either would have included a bit more at the top, or a bit less - the half included words are a bit distracting to me (how''s that for picky). Not sure how it fits with the challenge (the motion is in the wrong subject for me, and I went lower for that, sorry), but I still like it.', '2007-01-23 17:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271691, 452994, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really nice attempt here, but nothing is quite sharp enough for me to pull out; the ball is close, and I hope that''s what you were going for, but the composition doesn''t let me see very much in terms of motion (the crowd is too far back, and just looks out of focus to my eyes).</td>', 'Really nice attempt here, but nothing is quite sharp enough for me to pull out; the ball is close, and I hope that''s what you were going for, but the composition doesn''t let me see very much in terms of motion (the crowd is too far back, and just looks out of focus to my eyes).', '2007-01-23 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271711, 453668, 43073, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what to think of this image; clear subject, blurred background, but it just wasn''t interesting subject matter to me, and the background is so blurred it almost isn''t there as more than color - the image doesn''t convey a feeling of motion to me.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what to think of this image; clear subject, blurred background, but it just wasn''t interesting subject matter to me, and the background is so blurred it almost isn''t there as more than color - the image doesn''t convey a feeling of motion to me.', '2007-01-23 17:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271717, 452335, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the image, though I may have liked a bit more contrast (I may not have to, I''d have to see it to know for sure, and the sky might have prevented it, as it''s pretty bright already), but I don''t get a feeling of motion from it.</td>', 'I like the image, though I may have liked a bit more contrast (I may not have to, I''d have to see it to know for sure, and the sky might have prevented it, as it''s pretty bright already), but I don''t get a feeling of motion from it.', '2007-01-23 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271723, 452788, 43073, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what to think of this shot; I don''t get motion from it, nothing is blurred, and I would have liked to have seen more work with the composition (why include the side-view mirror on the left; it''s distracting and unnecessary). The sky is quite bright, and the colors seem a bit subdued.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what to think of this shot; I don''t get motion from it, nothing is blurred, and I would have liked to have seen more work with the composition (why include the side-view mirror on the left; it''s distracting and unnecessary). The sky is quite bright, and the colors seem a bit subdued.', '2007-01-23 17:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271726, 452952, 43073, '<td valign="top">Things are moving here, but I don''t see anything as a sharp subject - I couldn''t really find a subject at all. I like the colors, but I probably would have cropped out the statue on the right (doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image to my eyes).</td>', 'Things are moving here, but I don''t see anything as a sharp subject - I couldn''t really find a subject at all. I like the colors, but I probably would have cropped out the statue on the right (doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image to my eyes).', '2007-01-23 17:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271832, 454345, 56658, '<td valign="top">If this was done without processing more blur in then kudos. either way very nice effect.</td>', 'If this was done without processing more blur in then kudos. either way very nice effect.', '2007-01-23 17:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271835, 454204, 72714, '<td valign="top">Good movement but would like to have seen the dog facing the camera. I like the soft, almost monochrome colours.</td>', 'Good movement but would like to have seen the dog facing the camera. I like the soft, almost monochrome colours.', '2007-01-23 17:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271844, 451234, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours but I feel the bird is placed to close to the edge of the frame and has ''nowhere to fly'', so to speak.</td>', 'Lovely colours but I feel the bird is placed to close to the edge of the frame and has ''nowhere to fly'', so to speak.', '2007-01-23 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271851, 453974, 56658, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic. You have done a great job at making this little car look like it is going super fast.</td>', 'this is fantastic. You have done a great job at making this little car look like it is going super fast.', '2007-01-23 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271859, 453263, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph. The diagonal line dividing the photograph into triangles, follows the snowboarder downhill and adds to the sense of speed already given by the blurred background.</td>', 'I like this photograph. The diagonal line dividing the photograph into triangles, follows the snowboarder downhill and adds to the sense of speed already given by the blurred background.', '2007-01-23 17:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271882, 452938, 72714, '<td valign="top">The rider is nice and sharp but movement is very evident in the bikes tyres and the background. I also enjoy the bright colours against the muted background. The bike is also well positioned, leaving good spacing in the direction of travel. Well done.</td>', 'The rider is nice and sharp but movement is very evident in the bikes tyres and the background. I also enjoy the bright colours against the muted background. The bike is also well positioned, leaving good spacing in the direction of travel. Well done.', '2007-01-23 17:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271890, 453757, 72714, '<td valign="top">A good sense of movement but I feel the car is a little too close to the front of the frame. Nice punchy colours.</td>', 'A good sense of movement but I feel the car is a little too close to the front of the frame. Nice punchy colours.', '2007-01-23 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271940, 454002, 72714, '<td valign="top">This shot works really well in b&amp;w. The bicycle looks almost antique and kind of comical and stands out crisp and clear against the blurred background. This picture makes me smile!</td>', 'This shot works really well in b&w. The bicycle looks almost antique and kind of comical and stands out crisp and clear against the blurred background. This picture makes me smile!', '2007-01-23 17:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271953, 452607, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in the wings and the background, while the bodies and heads remain almost statice. Well photographed!</td>', 'I like the movement in the wings and the background, while the bodies and heads remain almost statice. Well photographed!', '2007-01-23 18:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271966, 453552, 72714, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed this photograph. It''s happy, fun and colourful! One comment though, try cropping the legs at the top of the frame as they are a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'I enjoyed this photograph. It''s happy, fun and colourful! One comment though, try cropping the legs at the top of the frame as they are a bit of a distraction.', '2007-01-23 18:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
