(3273535, 453495, 60862, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s having fun! :)  I like that you thought of a different subject from the dozens of bikes and cars.  I think with a little more "zoom" in the man, you''d have done better.  Like had him bent over making "vroom" noises and running instead of walking.  Compositionally, it''d be better to give him a little more room above his head.  I like that you got down to the level of the cart and shot up at him, though.</td>', 'Looks like he''s having fun! :)  I like that you thought of a different subject from the dozens of bikes and cars.  I think with a little more "zoom" in the man, you''d have done better.  Like had him bent over making "vroom" noises and running instead of walking.  Compositionally, it''d be better to give him a little more room above his head.  I like that you got down to the level of the cart and shot up at him, though.', '2007-01-24 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3273539, 454082, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another nice shot from team suck! :)</td>', 'Another nice shot from team suck! :)', '2007-01-24 00:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
