(3274621, 454036, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow, I didn''t see this image before (only had time to do a partial vote during the challenge).  I love the dreamy quality to it.  I can see where some might not get the "panning" because of the quality of the background.  But still, this is a *very* nice image and probably would have scored much higher outside of the panning challenge.<br/></td>', 'Wow, I didn''t see this image before (only had time to do a partial vote during the challenge).  I love the dreamy quality to it.  I can see where some might not get the "panning" because of the quality of the background.  But still, this is a *very* nice image and probably would have scored much higher outside of the panning challenge.', '2007-01-24 07:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
