(3275042, 454261, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job on this.   There''s such a teeny tiny fine line between a GREAT one of these and one that just passes as average.  Not much difference between this one and the great ones if you ask me!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think you did a great job on this.   There''s such a teeny tiny fine line between a GREAT one of these and one that just passes as average.  Not much difference between this one and the great ones if you ask me! ', '2007-01-24 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
