(3276440, 453742, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nope, doesn''t meet the challenge, but man, is it a great shot! :)  Just everything about it, including the tilt as you go around the curve.<br/> <br/>As to "who''s to say," well, it''s like this:  you don''t get to make up definitions just because you want to try something outside the definition.</td>', 'Nope, doesn''t meet the challenge, but man, is it a great shot! :)  Just everything about it, including the tilt as you go around the curve. As to "who''s to say," well, it''s like this:  you don''t get to make up definitions just because you want to try something outside the definition.', '2007-01-24 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
