(3276458, 454036, 16780, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  And of course, lost on the majority of this audience.  I normally don''t like frames but the thin white one is a nice touch here.  Not overbearing.  <b>Everything</b> in this presentation just works perfectly!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  And of course, lost on the majority of this audience.  I normally don''t like frames but the thin white one is a nice touch here.  Not overbearing.  Everything in this presentation just works perfectly!', '2007-01-24 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3276617, 453922, 64670, '<td valign="top">I want to sincerely THANK YOU all for commenting on my image during this challenge.<br/> <br/>All comments are very much appreciated.<br/> <br/>I agree with the Arcanist that the trampoline didn''t exactly stand out in black and white (that''s why I choose to name it Trampoline - GRIN!) but due to the positioning of the trampoline in this yard, the other colours, including the colors the child was wearing we SO distracting that the better option was to convert the image.  If I''d kept the colors the strength of the image - the girls face would have been dwarfed.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I want to sincerely THANK YOU all for commenting on my image during this challenge. All comments are very much appreciated. I agree with the Arcanist that the trampoline didn''t exactly stand out in black and white (that''s why I choose to name it Trampoline - GRIN!) but due to the positioning of the trampoline in this yard, the other colours, including the colors the child was wearing we SO distracting that the better option was to convert the image.  If I''d kept the colors the strength of the image - the girls face would have been dwarfed. ', '2007-01-24 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3276662, 454311, 16739, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites   , great job skip</td>', 'one of my favorites   , great job skip', '2007-01-24 16:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
