(3276751, 452506, 66799, '<td valign="top">Tnx to all the commenters and viewers,<br/>I''m really did not understand the theme of the challange, I thought it was all about motion, and I c I was wrong.<br/>Anyway, tnx to those who liked the picture inspite the fact it does not match the challange :)</td>', 'Tnx to all the commenters and viewers,I''m really did not understand the theme of the challange, I thought it was all about motion, and I c I was wrong.Anyway, tnx to those who liked the picture inspite the fact it does not match the challange :)', '2007-01-24 17:19:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3276780, 453742, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> Nope, doesn''t meet the challenge, but man, is it a great shot! :)  Just everything about it, including the tilt as you go around the curve.<br/> <br/>As to "who''s to say," well, it''s like this:  you don''t get to make up definitions just because you want to try something outside the definition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ok, if you say so, let it be my best DNMC shot  :). And thanks for the fav!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-24 17:25:28.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413: Nope, doesn''t meet the challenge, but man, is it a great shot! :)  Just everything about it, including the tilt as you go around the curve. As to "who''s to say," well, it''s like this:  you don''t get to make up definitions just because you want to try something outside the definition.   ok, if you say so, let it be my best DNMC shot  :). And thanks for the fav!', '2007-01-24 17:24:42.000000', '2007-01-24 17:25:28.000000', 0),
