(3280343, 453742, 38032, '<td valign="top">I have to tell you ... I shot about 147 pics of myself on a bike for the last panning challenge and had nothing good from it ... it''s harder than it looks.  I didn''t have the guts to ride with the D70 though - I had the Lumix.   Anyway, this is great - nice job.</td>', 'I have to tell you ... I shot about 147 pics of myself on a bike for the last panning challenge and had nothing good from it ... it''s harder than it looks.  I didn''t have the guts to ride with the D70 though - I had the Lumix.   Anyway, this is great - nice job.', '2007-01-25 08:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
