(3357217, 453922, 51538, '<td valign="top">Challenges aside, this is a very elegant image.  The eye contact and motion blur really enhance the viewer''s experience.  Charming photo.</td>', 'Challenges aside, this is a very elegant image.  The eye contact and motion blur really enhance the viewer''s experience.  Charming photo.', '2007-02-12 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
