(3410056, 453933, 74657, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by clp1000:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a shame you didn''t enter this in the wildlife challenge (running at the same time) because you''d have been looking at a ribbon - fantastic picture </i></td></tr></table>i agree totaly- definitly a winner.</td>', 'Originally posted by clp1000: It''s a shame you didn''t enter this in the wildlife challenge (running at the same time) because you''d have been looking at a ribbon - fantastic picture i agree totaly- definitly a winner.', '2007-02-27 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
