(3470553, 454082, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like this. You did a fantastic job with this. It''s almost unreal in the sense that the main subject is a person that doesn''t appear to be traveling as fast as the image lets you believe. I don''t know how you did it but great job.</td>', 'I really like this. You did a fantastic job with this. It''s almost unreal in the sense that the main subject is a person that doesn''t appear to be traveling as fast as the image lets you believe. I don''t know how you did it but great job.', '2007-03-18 21:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3498628, 454082, 37818, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how I missed this one...I love the colours, the orange really pops, it is a great slice of city life picture...</td>', 'I don''t know how I missed this one...I love the colours, the orange really pops, it is a great slice of city life picture...', '2007-03-30 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3507094, 454345, 27763, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the girl is incredible, considering that <i>everything</i> else in the photo is <i>extremely</i> blurry.<br/> <br/>This is a very good capture.  It has a great sense of motion, color, and above all... fun!  I also like the nice, simple title.  Well done!</td>', 'The sharpness of the girl is incredible, considering that everything else in the photo is extremely blurry. This is a very good capture.  It has a great sense of motion, color, and above all... fun!  I also like the nice, simple title.  Well done!', '2007-04-01 20:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3508648, 453901, 56548, '<td valign="top">Great shot, brings back memory when I used to ride around Saigon on of those. Cyclo operators are usually the poorest in Vietnam society, now with the introductions of the taxi in the past 10 years, many of those operator lives have been changed completely. I believe you can still find cyclos on the streets of Saigon and Hanoi, but those are owned and run by tourism companies, their operators can speak a little of English, are well groomed and equiped with cellphones. <br/> <br/>It brings me joy and evokes a noltagic feeling in me to see DPCers submiting their shots about my homeland.<br/> <br/>Thank You<br/> <br/>Nathan<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-02 01:25:48.</i></td>', 'Great shot, brings back memory when I used to ride around Saigon on of those. Cyclo operators are usually the poorest in Vietnam society, now with the introductions of the taxi in the past 10 years, many of those operator lives have been changed completely. I believe you can still find cyclos on the streets of Saigon and Hanoi, but those are owned and run by tourism companies, their operators can speak a little of English, are well groomed and equiped with cellphones.  It brings me joy and evokes a noltagic feeling in me to see DPCers submiting their shots about my homeland. Thank You Nathan', '2007-04-02 02:20:04.000000', '2007-04-02 02:25:48.000000', 0),
(3527646, 451738, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture and nice to have the details there - thanks :o)</td>', 'Great picture and nice to have the details there - thanks :o)', '2007-04-07 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
