(3557988, 453742, 42013, '<td valign="top">Didnt see this one earlier. I like it and your new one, although the frenetic action of this one appeals to me more.</td>', 'Didnt see this one earlier. I like it and your new one, although the frenetic action of this one appeals to me more.', '2007-04-18 03:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3566460, 454082, 54778, '<td valign="top">I love the irony between the mood of the picture and where it''s actually set/title.. The abstracty feeling is amazing.. very underrated...</td>', 'I love the irony between the mood of the picture and where it''s actually set/title.. The abstracty feeling is amazing.. very underrated...', '2007-04-20 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3586671, 452509, 77549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. For a 1:10 in the 100 Backstroke, this girl has a smooth stroke, and her turnover is fairly high too. I know how hard it is to shoot in poorly lit indoor pools. I swam for 16 years.  One of my favorite shots is the start of backstroke races when the swimmer''s back is arched out over the pool.  Unfortunately, flash photography isn''t allowed, and once again, slower shutter speeds make it hard to grab. I think you did a great job here. Probably could have bumped to 800 or even 1600 ISO as the Canons generally have low noise at ISOs even up to 1600. It probably could have gained you some shutter speed.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. For a 1:10 in the 100 Backstroke, this girl has a smooth stroke, and her turnover is fairly high too. I know how hard it is to shoot in poorly lit indoor pools. I swam for 16 years.  One of my favorite shots is the start of backstroke races when the swimmer''s back is arched out over the pool.  Unfortunately, flash photography isn''t allowed, and once again, slower shutter speeds make it hard to grab. I think you did a great job here. Probably could have bumped to 800 or even 1600 ISO as the Canons generally have low noise at ISOs even up to 1600. It probably could have gained you some shutter speed.', '2007-04-26 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3589997, 454082, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is good, even though nothing is in focus.  The background really makes this shot.  The streaks of colors/lights convey a sense of motion, hustle/bustle and life (and are just plain nice to look at!)  I also enjoy taking photos like this.  It''s fun.</td>', 'This is good, even though nothing is in focus.  The background really makes this shot.  The streaks of colors/lights convey a sense of motion, hustle/bustle and life (and are just plain nice to look at!)  I also enjoy taking photos like this.  It''s fun.', '2007-04-28 09:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
