(4032092, 454079, 48471, '<td valign="top">The tension on her face speaks volumes. One of the best sports photos, but not only that, it''s more than sports, it''s about humans, how we waste energy so that we gain more. It reminded me of one passage from Bronowski''s the Ascent of Man, when he explains why we humans engage in sports, while animals don''t.</td>', 'The tension on her face speaks volumes. One of the best sports photos, but not only that, it''s more than sports, it''s about humans, how we waste energy so that we gain more. It reminded me of one passage from Bronowski''s the Ascent of Man, when he explains why we humans engage in sports, while animals don''t.', '2007-08-27 08:26:10.000000', NULL, 0),
